@startuml
[*] --> InitialState
InitialState --> TaskCreated : Task Created
TaskCreated --> TaskBeingEdited : Start Editing
TaskBeingEdited --> SynchronizingChanges : Changes Made
SynchronizingChanges --> TaskBeingEdited : Synchronization Complete
TaskBeingEdited --> TaskCompleted : Editing Complete
TaskCompleted --> [*] : Task Completed
@enduml
